summary: Discover tests relevant for execution

description: |
    Gather tests and their metadata for execution. Use the ``how`` key
    to select a discovery method, such as ``fmf`` for tests defined in
    an fmf tree or ``shell`` for tests defined directly in the plan.
    See the :ref:`/plugins/discover` documentation for available methods
    and supported options.

example: |
    discover:
        how: fmf
        filter: tier:1

link:
    - implemented-by: /tmt/steps/discover
